  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the bilateral programme in Nigeria to support climate resilient and sustainable health systems in country</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support the bilateral programme in Nigeria to deliver work via Palladium Lafiya project to support climate resilient and sustainable health systems in Nigeria. Building on the diagnostic and capacity building work supported by the component 404 in Nigeria, it will extend the Health National Adaptation plan to the State level and build on the CRIBS work being carried out by UNICEF.</narrative>
  </description>
